<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
  <name>Archinity - Drifters</name>
  <author>cjd72</author>
  <packageId>archinity.drifters</packageId>
  <supportedVersions>
    <li>1.6</li>
  </supportedVersions>
  <description>Part of the Archinity suite.

Adds the Starjack Free Companies: a neutral, hostile-capable spacefaring faction that lives entirely in orbit.

Unlike Odyssey's Traders Guild, the Free Companies are a real power - they can send military aid, they generate quest sites, and they field a full combat ladder. You can ally with them, hire them against the Glitterites, or take their stations by force.

Starjack-dominant, and contained: the xenotype never leaks into planetside factions. While relations are neutral they stay off the surface entirely, so a spacer faction will not come wandering into a neolithic camp.

Requires Odyssey (orbit layer, starjack xenotype, astropolitan culture) and Biotech.</description>
  <!-- Odyssey is hard: Factions_FreeCompanies.xml references PlanetLayerDef
       Orbit in layerWhitelist and arrivalLayerWhitelist, MemeDef Shipborn in
       requiredMemes, and PawnKinds_FreeCompanies.xml references
       Apparel_VacsuitHelmet in apparelRequired. All three are Odyssey defs and
       none of those references is MayRequire guarded, so without Odyssey they
       are unresolved cross references.

       Biotech is declared because it owns this faction's identity rather than
       because it errors: Starjack 0.75, Genie 0.08 and Hussar 0.04 are the
       whole xenotypeSet, and Archinity_FC_Child is the only child kind. All of
       those are MayRequire guarded, so a Biotech-less load produces an
       all-baseliner faction silently rather than an error.

       Ideology is deliberately NOT declared. Every Ideology reference in this
       mod is a disallowedMemes entry or a structureMemeWeights weight, all
       guarded, all inert without it. Nothing here needs Ideology to be what it
       says it is. -->
  <modDependencies>
    <li>
      <packageId>Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech</packageId>
      <displayName>Biotech</displayName>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey</packageId>
      <displayName>Odyssey</displayName>
    </li>
  </modDependencies>
  <loadAfter>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Royalty</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey</li>
    <li>OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core</li>
    <li>vanillaracesexpanded.starjack</li>
    <li>shunter.bettertradersguild</li>
    <li>archinity.origins</li>
    <li>archinity.pacing</li>
  </loadAfter>
</ModMetaData>
